# Shell scripts run on the pod (Linux) via `ssh ... "bash -s" < script`. A
# CRLF checkout on Windows (common with core.autocrlf=true) sends literal \r
# bytes into the remote bash, which breaks `set -euo pipefail` on line 1 and
# fails cryptically. Force LF regardless of the checkout platform's autocrlf.
*.sh text eol=lf
